%%label IV. Allegro con fuoco. Presto
%%note Finale: a galloping rondo whose refrain is built on the cell (A, B flat, C sharp, D); a hymn in F major, a fugato on the cell, and a Presto coda in D major where the cell finally rises by step.
X:4
T:Beethoven’s Missing Quartet
T:IV. Allegro con fuoco
C:Lor, in the manner of Beethoven
M:2/4
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro con fuoco" 1/4=100
%%score [1 | 2 | 3 | 4]
V:1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:3 clef=alto name="Vla."
V:4 clef=bass name="Vc."
K:Dm
V:1
